WEBVTT

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:03.220
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:04.060
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:05.310
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:07.660
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:11.030
This time, it's a showdown 
between Tadase-kun and Ikuto!

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:13.500
How awful! Whatever shall we do?

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:17.240
We've gotta deal with those X Eggs, 
and patch things up with Tadase-kun!

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:19.980
You can do it, Amu-chan! 
I'll be rooting for you!

00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:20.890
Me, too!

00:00:20.890 --> 00:00:23.520
I will cheer you on as well!

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:24.580
Doki!

00:00:48.510 --> 00:00:51.360
I'm gonna tell you a secret.

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:54.270
Don't tell <i>anyone</i>, okay?

00:00:54.270 --> 00:00:57.160
Even though I'm not girly at all,

00:00:57.160 --> 00:00:59.930
two certain boys said they like me!

00:00:59.930 --> 00:01:02.870
Jump up a bit into the sky.

00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:05.750
My dearest friends are always there.

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:08.580
Even if you suddenly Character Change,

00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:11.490
I'll be there to stop you with my great big heart.

00:01:11.490 --> 00:01:14.360
Pinky swear!

00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:16.760
Cross my heart!

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:19.970
Lucky, happy, leave it to me!

00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:23.020
That'd be universal peace, but...

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:25.770
I'll end up protectin' everyone's hearts.

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:28.540
Let's all smile together!

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:31.400
Lucky, happy, leave it to me!

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:34.210
That's world peace! Yeah, that!

00:01:34.510 --> 00:01:37.440
Everyone has dreams, so I'm gonna protect 'em!

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:40.260
Make a victory sign together!

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:59.880
Episode 80
Believe in Each Other! Platinum Heart!

00:02:04.570 --> 00:02:05.580
Ikuto!

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:09.340
My heart: Unlock.

00:02:18.660 --> 00:02:21.030
Character Transformation: Death Rebel.

00:03:00.190 --> 00:03:02.160
Amu-chan, you handle the X Eggs!

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:03.200
Right.

00:03:05.970 --> 00:03:09.460
Spiral Heart Special!

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:24.220
Tadase-kun!

00:03:27.490 --> 00:03:30.730
I haven't forgiven you for the past!

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:33.150
I don't understand!

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:36.860
What really happened?

00:03:37.530 --> 00:03:38.780
Ikuto-niisan!

00:03:56.910 --> 00:03:58.200
Ikuto...

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:03.510
It's always been this way... You do things 
without ever explaining!

00:04:07.370 --> 00:04:14.770
But whenever you look at me, it's not hatred 
I see in your eyes... It's sadness.

00:04:15.510 --> 00:04:17.030
Tadase-kun...

00:04:17.030 --> 00:04:18.270
Ikuto...

00:04:22.600 --> 00:04:25.990
I want to know the truth.

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:27.630
Ikuto-niisan...

00:04:27.630 --> 00:04:29.580
No... Tsukiyomi Ikuto!

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:36.920
Ikuto!

00:04:37.900 --> 00:04:39.200
Ikuto!

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:40.100
Keep back...

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:43.730
You... You can't!

00:04:43.730 --> 00:04:46.090
Stay away from me!

00:05:09.270 --> 00:05:10.780
What's the matter?

00:05:12.360 --> 00:05:15.120
What are you doing, Tsukiyomi Ikuto?

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:19.750
You'll need more X Eggs than this 
to lure out the Embryo, you know.

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:21.210
Who's that?

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:24.210
Easter's Director, Hoshino Kazuomi.

00:05:24.210 --> 00:05:26.100
Ikuto's stepfather.

00:05:27.740 --> 00:05:31.680
Our mother's wearied heart 
had reached its limit.

00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:33.400
And so...

00:05:35.690 --> 00:05:37.780
She betrayed us.

00:05:39.050 --> 00:05:41.730
She was remarried to Easter's Director.

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:44.360
So that's him...

00:05:45.580 --> 00:05:47.500
You again?

00:05:47.500 --> 00:05:52.040
It's about your bedtime, little lady. 
Get on home now!

00:05:55.240 --> 00:05:59.880
I can't abandon all these 
people's hearts' eggs...

00:06:00.970 --> 00:06:03.760
I'm going to protect everyone's hearts!

00:06:04.720 --> 00:06:09.880
These sacrifices are a small price 
to pay to obtain the Embryo.

00:06:11.160 --> 00:06:14.010
Why are you letting him 
boss you around, Ikuto?!

00:06:14.360 --> 00:06:19.900
What's the matter, Ikuto? You needn't hold back, 
even if your opponents are mere children!

00:06:21.510 --> 00:06:23.320
What could that be?

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:27.340
It's a tuning fork; a tool used to 
tune musical instruments.

00:06:28.270 --> 00:06:29.910
Is that thing behind this?

00:06:30.210 --> 00:06:33.730
Perhaps you could use 
a bit of a tune-up...

00:06:42.270 --> 00:06:43.090
Do it!

00:06:55.360 --> 00:06:56.930
Ikuto, stop it!

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:02.600
As I thought, this isn't the real Ikuto...

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:10.950
Ikuto is being manipulated by Easter.

00:07:11.540 --> 00:07:13.200
How despicable!

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:15.890
Hmph. Despicable?

00:07:15.890 --> 00:07:20.500
Just look at him. Ikuto is gladly 
performing his duties for Easter.

00:07:20.780 --> 00:07:24.500
Liar! I believe in Ikuto!

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:26.750
You believe in him?

00:07:27.100 --> 00:07:29.510
That's what I've decided... 
and why I'll save him!

00:07:29.770 --> 00:07:35.200
And this is exactly why children are such nuisances. 
They fall so easily into juvenile relationships.

00:07:35.200 --> 00:07:39.670
Faith in another is nothing 
but worthless naiveté.

00:07:39.670 --> 00:07:40.730
You're wrong!

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:45.230
You might be able to keep on 
living without believing...

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:50.400
But if those feelings disappear, 
your heart will be empty!

00:07:51.430 --> 00:07:55.590
Having faith in someone else 
is what makes you stronger!

00:07:55.590 --> 00:07:58.740
It <i>is</i> important to believe!

00:07:59.690 --> 00:08:01.100
Tadase-kun...

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:11.800
Believing in another makes 
the heart grow strong!

00:08:12.580 --> 00:08:15.800
Believing in another makes 
the heart grow kind!

00:08:16.520 --> 00:08:20.720
Believing in another 
is a beautiful, precious gift!

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:25.880
Platinum Heart!

00:08:29.130 --> 00:08:30.240
What is...

00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:31.490
Wow!

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:38.310
Amu-chan!

00:08:38.310 --> 00:08:38.990
Right!

00:09:04.090 --> 00:09:05.810
Look at that!

00:09:08.780 --> 00:09:10.000
The Embryo!

00:09:11.160 --> 00:09:15.240
The mysterious egg that will grant any wish 
to the person who obtains it...

00:09:15.480 --> 00:09:17.610
Where is it? I can't see it!

00:09:17.890 --> 00:09:19.530
Amu-chan!

00:09:19.530 --> 00:09:20.490
Right!

00:09:24.510 --> 00:09:25.750
Go, Ikuto!

00:09:26.050 --> 00:09:28.480
Don't let those brats beat you to it!

00:09:30.430 --> 00:09:31.590
Holy Crown!

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:41.670
Amu-chan...

00:09:58.080 --> 00:09:59.470
The Embryo...

00:10:05.210 --> 00:10:06.870
What is this light?

00:10:19.310 --> 00:10:21.610
What is this feeling?

00:10:27.130 --> 00:10:28.520
Amu-chan!

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:30.230
Amu-chan!

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:37.530
Tadase-kun...

00:10:56.310 --> 00:10:57.640
Are you okay?

00:10:57.640 --> 00:11:00.260
Yeah... But the Embryo...

00:11:01.420 --> 00:11:03.220
Ikuto!

00:11:04.010 --> 00:11:05.470
Where did you go-nya?

00:11:05.940 --> 00:11:07.140
Ikuto!

00:11:07.830 --> 00:11:10.650
I-Ikuto!

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:31.140
What should we do? Ikuto's being 
controlled by Easter.

00:11:31.140 --> 00:11:34.100
It'll be all right. 
We'll figure it out together.

00:11:36.460 --> 00:11:37.890
Huh?

00:11:37.890 --> 00:11:39.600
Where am I?

00:11:39.600 --> 00:11:41.020
An amusement park?

00:11:41.020 --> 00:11:41.680
Why?

00:11:42.030 --> 00:11:43.330
What should we do?

00:11:43.330 --> 00:11:45.740
First things first, we have 
to calm everyone down.

00:11:57.420 --> 00:12:01.770
Today is this amusement park's 
special promotional day!

00:12:01.770 --> 00:12:04.080
That's what you should do!

00:12:04.080 --> 00:12:06.620
Just follow our lead!

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:09.040
Ready, Amu-chan? Character Change!

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:15.810
Today's a special promotion day! 
Ride all you want for free!

00:12:15.810 --> 00:12:18.460
This is completely humiliating!

00:12:21.340 --> 00:12:22.960
They said they're having a 
special promotion today.

00:12:22.960 --> 00:12:24.450
Let's have fun!

00:12:26.330 --> 00:12:27.930
Looks like a success.

00:12:30.100 --> 00:12:33.690
Thank goodness everyone has 
their hearts' eggs back.

00:12:34.370 --> 00:12:35.270
Yeah...

00:12:35.790 --> 00:12:41.710
But Easter will continue to use 
Tsukiyomi Ikuto to try and get the Embryo.

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:50.220
The atmosphere is tense...

00:12:50.220 --> 00:12:51.310
Shh!

00:12:51.310 --> 00:12:52.930
You can do it, Amu-chan!

00:12:52.930 --> 00:12:54.510
Fight!

00:12:56.630 --> 00:12:58.710
Um, Tadase-kun...

00:13:00.110 --> 00:13:01.620
I'm sorry!

00:13:02.100 --> 00:13:03.170
Amu-chan...

00:13:05.280 --> 00:13:07.470
I'll tell you everything.

00:13:28.420 --> 00:13:32.970
Remember when we all went 
to visit the shrine for New Year's?

00:13:32.970 --> 00:13:36.080
That was the day Ikuto appeared.

00:13:37.430 --> 00:13:40.460
He honestly came out of nowhere.

00:13:40.760 --> 00:13:44.200
Ah, that was refreshing.

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:45.600
Time for bed!

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:57.170
What's going on?

00:13:58.120 --> 00:14:04.510
That night, Ikuto hid out at my place after taking 
back the violin Easter had stolen from him.

00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:06.120
That's what Yoru said.

00:14:08.630 --> 00:14:13.720
Ikuto was being hunted down by 
Easter so he couldn't go home.

00:14:13.720 --> 00:14:15.290
He had nowhere to go.

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:17.460
This ain't good-nya.

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:20.580
Is there a warm place nearby 
where he can sleep?

00:14:21.740 --> 00:14:26.400
Yoru carried Ikuto to my room.

00:14:26.400 --> 00:14:30.930
And that's how he ended up 
being a freeloader at my house.

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:33.810
I couldn't tell my parents.

00:14:34.840 --> 00:14:37.810
I lied to everyone.

00:14:38.870 --> 00:14:45.400
But Ikuto was actually sick, 
so I couldn't just throw him out.

00:14:46.680 --> 00:14:52.180
You called Ikuto a black cat who brings 
nothing but misfortune...

00:14:52.180 --> 00:14:54.590
But I didn't agree.

00:14:56.690 --> 00:14:59.370
Ikuto made me so angry sometimes...

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:00.820
And we fought a lot.

00:15:00.820 --> 00:15:04.250
But sometimes, he could be really responsible.

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:08.470
So I feel like he's not a bad person.

00:15:09.570 --> 00:15:13.360
And after that, Ikuto stayed in 
your room the whole time?

00:15:13.360 --> 00:15:14.470
No...

00:15:15.150 --> 00:15:17.850
I brought crepes for you, Ikuto.

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:27.740
Ikuto suddenly disappeared one day.

00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:33.330
Honestly, he does whatever he wants.

00:15:33.330 --> 00:15:36.690
He'll suddenly appear and then 
disappear just as quickly.

00:15:37.520 --> 00:15:40.120
And then show up again...

00:15:41.160 --> 00:15:42.620
Ikuto, what's wrong?

00:15:43.370 --> 00:15:44.570
Amu...

00:15:44.570 --> 00:15:45.920
Ikuto!

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:50.180
Ikuto was even weaker than before and, 
like I said, he had nowhere to go.

00:15:50.180 --> 00:15:52.970
So I brought him back 
to my room again.

00:15:53.520 --> 00:15:56.100
He was there that day, too...

00:16:00.550 --> 00:16:03.780
Even like I am right now...

00:16:03.780 --> 00:16:05.610
Will you let me fall in love with you?

00:16:06.970 --> 00:16:09.420
Ikuto was in my room.

00:16:13.150 --> 00:16:15.410
I knew things had to change.

00:16:16.230 --> 00:16:20.470
I couldn't keep lying to everyone...

00:16:20.470 --> 00:16:21.750
Tadase-kun.

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:26.710
Um... About Ikuto...

00:16:26.710 --> 00:16:27.590
Amu-chan.

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:31.080
Let me tell you something.

00:16:31.080 --> 00:16:35.050
Tsukiyomi Ikuto is a black cat who 
brings nothing but misfortune.

00:16:36.850 --> 00:16:39.010
But I couldn't bring myself to say it.

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:46.800
Mom?!

00:16:47.640 --> 00:16:49.740
And just <i>what</i> is going on here?

00:16:50.940 --> 00:16:55.190
My mom found out, and Ikuto left my room.

00:16:55.830 --> 00:16:57.200
But then...

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:01.620
Tsukiyomi Ikuto?

00:17:02.790 --> 00:17:05.290
Why... are you here?

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:08.590
I was shacking up in her room.

00:17:08.820 --> 00:17:10.390
Hey, Ikuto!

00:17:11.780 --> 00:17:14.410
What's the meaning of this, Amu-chan?

00:17:14.820 --> 00:17:17.260
Tadase-kun, I can explain...

00:17:17.260 --> 00:17:20.310
"Will you let me fall in love with you," was it?

00:17:21.200 --> 00:17:24.390
Quite a passionate confession for a little boy.

00:17:25.410 --> 00:17:27.100
Ikuto, why are you telling him-

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:28.540
Amu-chan...

00:17:29.500 --> 00:17:32.320
Amu-chan, you knew?

00:17:36.220 --> 00:17:37.450
I see...

00:17:39.330 --> 00:17:40.600
Wait!

00:17:51.930 --> 00:17:56.140
I'm sure Ikuto had reasons for what he said.

00:18:00.910 --> 00:18:08.560
I think he tried to make us angry on purpose, to cut us off, 
so we wouldn't be caught up in everything.

00:18:11.170 --> 00:18:15.940
But I said some horrible things to him...

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:18.680
I don't ever want to see you again!

00:18:18.680 --> 00:18:20.770
You...

00:18:20.770 --> 00:18:23.090
Just get the hell out of here!

00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:28.760
How could I do something like that?

00:18:31.240 --> 00:18:35.810
I was afraid you'd hate me, Tadase-kun.

00:18:35.810 --> 00:18:38.040
I didn't want to be hurt.

00:18:38.040 --> 00:18:40.590
I was only trying to protect myself.

00:18:41.330 --> 00:18:47.260
That was the first time I realized my 
actions actually hurt other people.

00:18:48.540 --> 00:18:56.780
But even once you knew, I couldn't work up the courage, and I went back and forth about apologizing to you.

00:18:58.280 --> 00:19:01.950
I'm sorry... So very sorry!

00:19:10.130 --> 00:19:13.080
Thank you for telling me the truth.

00:19:13.080 --> 00:19:15.580
I believe you, Amu-chan.

00:19:16.660 --> 00:19:18.170
Tadase-kun...

00:19:21.460 --> 00:19:27.060
I don't forgive Ikuto, but that's also 
why I don't want to hurt him.

00:19:28.790 --> 00:19:32.260
I need to know the truth.

00:19:32.260 --> 00:19:36.600
And for that, we have to free Ikuto 
from Easter's clutches, right?

00:19:36.600 --> 00:19:39.990
So... let's save Ikuto together.

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:42.740
Tadase-kun...

00:19:46.770 --> 00:19:48.580
Let's shake hands and make up.

00:19:50.570 --> 00:19:51.800
Sure!

00:20:12.930 --> 00:20:17.980
Those damn brats... Just a little more and 
we would've had the Embryo!

00:20:28.190 --> 00:20:31.600
The Death Rebel Plan is proceeding as planned.

00:20:32.270 --> 00:20:33.960
Is that so?

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:38.020
The Embryo appeared this very night.

00:20:38.020 --> 00:20:40.880
This is a great success, wouldn't you say?

00:20:41.630 --> 00:20:46.780
We will definitely obtain the Embryo next time, and present it to you, Boss.

00:20:46.780 --> 00:20:49.260
I look forward to it.

00:20:52.920 --> 00:20:58.070
Ikuto... I'm going to make you 
step up your efforts for me.

00:21:06.550 --> 00:21:08.630
And then...

00:21:09.540 --> 00:21:11.790
It's Amu-chi and Tadase!

00:21:15.010 --> 00:21:20.130
Back then, I used to play at that amusement park all the time.

00:21:20.580 --> 00:21:23.380
My family did, and Ikuto's, too.

00:21:23.650 --> 00:21:25.160
Ikuto?

00:21:25.160 --> 00:21:27.030
It was when I was little.

00:21:27.030 --> 00:21:28.390
Utau-chan was there as well.

00:21:30.370 --> 00:21:33.780
My oh my, aren't we friendly this morning!

00:21:33.780 --> 00:21:36.380
Good things happened yesterday, huh?

00:21:36.380 --> 00:21:39.040
Oh really now? Like what?

00:21:40.030 --> 00:21:42.940
Anyway, I'm glad you're 
feeling better, Hotori-kun.

00:21:43.200 --> 00:21:44.730
And Amu-chi, too!

00:21:45.310 --> 00:21:48.560
Sheesh, don't worry us like that.

00:21:48.560 --> 00:21:49.980
You guys...

00:21:57.060 --> 00:22:00.750
The future revealed to us by 
the stars is at times cruel.

00:22:01.520 --> 00:22:06.220
Like a lost little kitten, 
captured and locked in a cage.

00:22:06.940 --> 00:22:11.010
But the key to unlock that 
cage will soon be revealed.

00:22:12.870 --> 00:22:14.370
I've no doubt.

00:22:31.690 --> 00:22:36.260
Maybe I was wrong to pretend not to notice your worries.

00:22:36.260 --> 00:22:41.070
It's okay if you can't tell me everything.

00:22:41.070 --> 00:22:43.450
With that dark look on your face,

00:22:43.450 --> 00:22:45.690
go ahead and scream dark things.

00:22:45.690 --> 00:22:50.000
You shouldn't leave all those heavy feelings inside.

00:22:50.000 --> 00:22:51.480
Ride On!

00:22:54.870 --> 00:22:57.680
If you don't... If it's like that...

00:22:57.680 --> 00:23:00.600
You couldn't tell me if you wanted to, huh?

00:23:01.860 --> 00:23:04.350
I get it.

00:23:04.350 --> 00:23:07.010
I'm sure your circumstances will change one day.

00:23:07.010 --> 00:23:10.040
That time will come! That time is now!

00:23:13.860 --> 00:23:15.670
Don't you want to have someone

00:23:15.670 --> 00:23:18.300
say congratulations to you once in your life?

00:23:18.300 --> 00:23:23.230
Doesn't the breeze feel nice today?

00:23:23.230 --> 00:23:27.600
Even if you feel like it's all you can do to survive...

00:23:27.600 --> 00:23:32.470
You can make your life into something you enjoy. It's so nice!

00:23:32.470 --> 00:23:37.290
"Everything's for you."

00:23:37.290 --> 00:23:41.890
How about that?

00:23:43.590 --> 00:23:45.040
My boy!

00:23:50.110 --> 00:23:53.700
Amu-chan, I'm glad you patched 
things up with Tadase-kun!

00:23:53.700 --> 00:23:54.420
Yeah!

00:23:54.420 --> 00:23:56.870
But I'm a little worried about Ikuto.

00:23:56.870 --> 00:23:57.700
Yeah...

00:23:57.700 --> 00:23:59.910
Well then, we must go!

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:02.000
That's right, we have to!

00:24:02.000 --> 00:24:03.060
You can do it, Amu-chan!

00:24:03.060 --> 00:24:04.150
Fight!

00:24:04.150 --> 00:24:04.670
Yeah!

00:24:04.670 --> 00:24:06.190
Thanks, guys!

00:24:06.190 --> 00:24:07.860
But... go where?

00:24:07.860 --> 00:24:10.010
Isn't it obvious?

00:24:10.010 --> 00:24:12.170
Next time on Shugo Chara!! Doki:

00:24:12.170 --> 00:24:14.250
Infiltration! Easter Company!?

00:24:14.250 --> 00:24:16.870
I hope we can return home safely.

00:24:16.870 --> 00:24:19.280
Don't jinx us!
